          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A physical shortfall in crude availability raises near-term energy procurement and hedging requirements, prompting larger sovereign issuance and a higher term premium as markets price increased fiscal and balance-of-payments funding needs, pushing long-term yields up." />
