          <attvalue for="35" value="0.9" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A reduction in Russian energy supply flows tightens global crude balances and raises benchmark prices, whereas an increase in those flows exerts downward pressure on the oil price level observed in the US–Iran confrontation context." />
