          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rapid deleveraging and directional unwind by Japan‑based leveraged investors forces outsized sales of AI‑linked equities/ETFs with China/EU exposure, producing larger intraday and multi‑day swings in those AI asset prices." />
